The app uses the browser camera API (`navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia()`).

### Important

Do NOT try to solve this by simply repeatedly calling `getUserMedia()` or by pretending permission was granted.

The root issue is that browser camera access requires a secure context.

The application must be designed to work correctly when accessed from another device.

